In `const a = 1, { b } = obj`, debug mode highlights `const a` but not the destructuring declarator `{ b } = obj`, which isn't listed.
== args
--debug
input/const-binding-pattern.ts
== file input/const-binding-pattern.ts
const a = 1, { b } = obj;
== stdout
\x1b[32mconst a\x1b[0m = 1, { b } = obj;
== stderr
== exit 0
